{"meta":{"id":"tt1430607","type":"movie","name":"Operación Regalo","imdb_id":"tt1430607","description":"Con trucos más propios de espías, Santa y sus elfos de elite logran repartir en una sola noche los millones de regalos a los niños del mundo. ¿Qué significa que un solo niño no haya recibido su obsequio? ¡Todo! Pero será tarea del hijo menor de Santa, Arthur, enmendar este error y cumplir con la promesa de Navidad. Con la intención de devolverle el espíritu a las fiestas y con la ayuda del jubilado Grandsanta y un joven elfo rebelde, Arthur sale a último momento a entregar el regalo que falta. ¡Adorna la sala de emociones y diversión con este clásico navideño!","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt1430607.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hwtYE4Gs0IsBnrJ0nTZItOXlz19.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sriN3K5etvQTsgxX3BcIe1MWEqM.png","genres":["Drama","Animación","Familia","Comedia"],"releaseInfo":"2011","released":"2011-11-10T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"97 min","imdbRating":"7.1","country":"United Kingdom, United States of America","cast":["James McAvoy","Hugh Laurie","Bill Nighy","Jim Broadbent","Imelda Staunton","Ashley Jensen","Marc Wootton","Laura Linney","Eva Longoria","Ramona Marquez","Michael Palin","Sanjeev Bhaskar","Robbie Coltrane","Joan Cusack","Rhys Darby","Jane Horrocks","Iain McKee","Andy Serkis","Dominic West","Peter Baynham","Cody Cameron","Kevin Cecil","Kevin Eldon","Rich Fulcher","Bronagh Gallagher","Pete Jack","Danny John-Jules","Emma Kennedy","Stewart Lee","Seamus Malone"],"director":["Sarah Smith"],"writer":["Donnie Long","Sarah Smith","Peter Baynham"],"trailers":[{"source":"Z5QIucrDQKU","type":"Trailer","name":"Arthur Christmas: Operación regalo - Trailer en español","ytId":"Z5QIucrDQKU","lang":"es"},{"source":"7tk-WZSqIGQ","type":"Trailer","name":"ARTHUR CHRISTMAS - Official Trailer - In Theaters 11/23","ytId":"7tk-WZSqIGQ","lang":"en"},{"sour